          ]
        },
        "201770006": {
          "id": 201770006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "Let's just say I got some new clothes, and the puppets alone can't keep up with organizing them",
          "next": [
            201770007,
            201770008
          ]
        },
        "201770007": {
          "id": 201770007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "How many clothes did you buy? Give me one!",
          "next": [
            201770009
          ]
        },
        "201770008": {
          "id": 201770008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I'm {NICKNAME}. Give me some",
          "next": [
            201770009
          ]
        },
        "201770009": {
          "id": 201770009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "You can't wear that",
          "next": [
            201770010
          ]
        },
        "201770010": {
          "id": 201770010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "I bought it for the puppets",
          "next": [
            201770011,
            201770013
          ]
        },
        "201770011": {
          "id": 201770011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Do puppets need to change clothes too?",
          "next": [
            201770012
          ]
        },
        "201770012": {
          "id": 201770012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "Of course, with such a gorgeous face on them, who could've resisted buying pretty clothes for them",
          "next": [
            201770015
          ]
        },
        "201770013": {
          "id": 201770013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Darn it, even the puppet has more clothes than I do",
          "next": [
            201770014
          ]
        },
        "201770014": {
          "id": 201770014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "Oh, so you finally figured it out",
          "next": [
            201770015
          ]
        },
        "201770015": {
          "id": 201770015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "There are too many styles to count, so remember to sort them by category when organizing them",
          "next": [
            201770016
          ]
        },
        "201770016": {
          "id": 201770016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "Stylish at first glance, obviously something I'd wear, easy to spot. Let's sort these first",
          "next": [
            201770017
          ]
        },
        "201770017": {
          "id": 201770017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "Ruan Mei keeps recommending the same few things over and over, just put them together with the ones above",
          "next": [
            201770018
          ]
        },
        "201770018": {
          "id": 201770018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "The more eye-searing the color scheme is, the more it belongs in the retro section",
          "next": [
            201770019
          ]
        },
        "201770019": {
          "id": 201770019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "The harder it is to describe and understand the pattern, the more it belongs in haute couture",
          "next": [
            201770020
          ]
        },
        "201770020": {
          "id": 201770020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1401,
          "text": "As for the rest, just refer to the guide yourself",
          "next": [
            201770021
          ]
        },
        "201770021": {
          "id": 201770021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend has sent their location",
          "next": [
            201770022
